    {
        "k":  "h2",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "1. Hero \u0026 Intro ",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "Soprano ICE Laser Hair Reduction",
                         "b":  true
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "A lot of people put off laser hair removal because of one fear: that it\u0027s going to hurt. Older lasers did use short, intense bursts that felt sharp and carried more risk on darker skin, so the worry isn\u0027t unreasonable. Soprano ICE laser hair reduction in Delhi was designed with that problem in mind.",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "Instead of one hard pulse, it heats the hair follicle gradually while the handpiece keeps moving and the skin stays cooled. Most people describe the feeling as a warm tingle, nothing sharp. It also combines three laser wavelengths in one device, so the treatment can be matched to your skin tone and hair type, including darker Indian skin.",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "Available at Dadu Medical Centre Vasant Vihar (South Delhi) \u0026 Rajouri Garden (West Delhi), under Dr. Nivedita Dadu.",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "h2",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "2. How Soprano ICE Works",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "Soprano ICE, made by Alma Lasers, uses a method called SHR (Super Hair Removal). Rather than one strong flash, it fires many quick, low-energy pulses that build heat in the follicle slowly. The follicle gets hot enough to be damaged, but the skin doesn\u0027t take a sudden jolt.",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "Two features make this comfortable. ",
                         "b":  false
                     },
                     {
                         "t":  "ICE cooling",
                         "b":  true
                     },
                     {
                         "t":  " keeps the surface of the skin cool throughout, which helps limit discomfort and surface burns. The ",
                         "b":  false
                     },
                     {
                         "t":  "In-Motion technique",
                         "b":  true
                     },
                     {
                         "t":  " means the handpiece glides continuously over the area instead of stamping spot by spot, so coverage is even and nothing gets overheated.",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "The device carries three wavelengths, each reaching a different depth in the skin:",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "table",
        "rows":  [
                     [
                         "Wavelength",
                         "Skin types",
                         "Best suited for"
                     ],
                     [
                         "Alexandrite 755nm",
                         "I to IV",
                         "lighter, finer hair"
                     ],
                     [
                         "Diode 810nm",
                         "I to V",
                         "larger areas"
                     ],
                     [
                         "Nd:YAG 1064nm",
                         "I to VI",
                         "dark, coarse hair and darker skin"
                     ]
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "They can be used together in a combined \"Trio\" mode. Your specialist decides the combination after looking at your skin and hair.",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "h2",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "3. Areas That Can Be Treated",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "Legs, arms, underarms, back, chest, stomach and the bikini or Brazilian area are all common. On the face, Soprano ICE is used for the upper lip, chin, cheeks, neck and beard line. A smaller facial tip handles the precise work, like shaping eyebrows or the beard, and removing ear or nostril hair. Full body packages are available too.",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "For the groin area, a disposable tip is used for hygiene, and numbing cream is applied beforehand. The disposable tip is charged separately.",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "h2",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "4. Benefits Section",
                         "b":  false
                     }
                 ]
    },
    {
        "k":  "li",
