    {
        "k":  "p",
        "runs":  [
                     {
                         "t":  "How many sessions?",
                         "b":  true
                     },
                     {
                         "t":  " Most body areas need 6 to 8 sessions, spaced 4 to 6 weeks apart. Hormonal areas take longer, and the upper lip can need 6 to 10. A yearly touch-up may help keep results going. Progress usually looks something like this, though it varies with skin type, hair colour, area and hormones:",
